## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gargoyle Loot
## Notes: Every item in WoW Forever and where it comes from, in the Gargoyle window: dungeon and raid drops, crafting, vendors and reputation, and item sets. Search them all, see which are upgrades for your character, try them on, and keep a wishlist you share with the Gargoyle website. Needs the Gargoyle addon. Turn it on or off in Options > AddOns > Gargoyle.
